den human and a hidden machine, and tries to tell which is which. If the judge can’t reliably distinguish the machine from the human, the machine is said to pass the test. (→ `workspace/textbook/Artificial-Intelligence-A-Modern-Approach-4th.pdf`)\n\nIn short: it tests **human-like conversational behavior**, not necessarily true understanding.","textSignature":"msg_0bdbdc4f595235010169d5467ba634819b876d7d48802ed1ae"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.3-codex","usage":{"input":561,"output":227,"cacheRead":7808,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":8596,"cost":{"input":0.00098175,"output":0.003178,"cacheRead":0.0013664,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0055261500000000005}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775584884770}}
